      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The E15 error often indicates a drainage issue, so first, check your drain hose for kinks or blockages. To address potential water, unplug your dishwasher and carefully tilt it slightly to see if water drains out; use towels to soak up any visible moisture from the bottom interior. If the issue persists, inspect the sump area for obstructions, but avoid forcing anything inside the machine.",
