      "content": "the vinegar thing sounds okay but i'm worried it won't get the actual water sitting in the very bottom tray where the sensor is. is there any way to get a hair dryer or something in there to dry it? or i guess is there any way to check if something is actually blocking the sensor from the bottom? it feels like something is just sitting in that dark space underneath everything.",
